+ * S02-C7 — wiring the policy modal into the sign-up card.
+ *
+ * Steps pinned here: S02-S49 … S02-S58, S02-S71, and R17's cases 4 and 5
+ * (S02-S28 / S02-S29), which live here rather than in `consent-signup-gate.test.tsx`
